The password for the next level is stored somewhere on the server and has all of the following properties:

owned by user bandit7
owned by group bandit6
33 bytes in size

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
I followed the following process:_
1. First i logined into bandit 6 and listed the fiels in home dir4edtory but it was all empty.
2. Then i used the find command to find the file.
3. The following is the find command with parameters:-
    find / -type f -user bandit7 -group bandit6 -size 33c
      -type f ---> It speciifes that the type of filem is normal file.
      -user bandit7 ---> It specifies that the file is used by the user bandit7
      -group bandit6 ---> It specifeis thta the file is owned by bandit6.
      -size 33c ----> It specifeis the size of the file.
4. After running the command i got a result as follwos:-
     /var/lib/dpkg/info/bandit7.password
5.Then i used the cat command on the result directory and found ther password forf bandit 7.
